WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.710 --> 01:29.710
I'm Chocolat!

01:30.320 --> 01:32.570
For the Queen selection test,

01:32.570 --> 01:35.880
I came to the Human World
with my best friend and rival, Vanilla.

01:36.880 --> 01:40.940
Whoever collects the most human hearts gets
to become Queen of the Magical World.

01:41.960 --> 01:46.260
For my mom who didn't get to be Queen,
I'll become Queen for sure!

01:47.900 --> 01:50.240
The Love Battle Between Frog and Mouse.

01:55.470 --> 01:59.040
Since we have wands, we can
summon familiars, can't we?

01:59.610 --> 02:01.550
I-I wonder if I can...

02:01.910 --> 02:03.980
In any case, let's draw the magic pentagram.

02:05.680 --> 02:07.690
Nettle Gradile Julle!

02:09.290 --> 02:10.820
Sugar Sugar Rune!

02:20.400 --> 02:21.870
I summon you, familiar!
Show yourself, and obey!

02:34.010 --> 02:36.380
Did you summon me, Vanilla-chama?

02:36.950 --> 02:40.250
How do you do? My name is Blanca.

02:40.250 --> 02:44.360
I came from the Magical World in
order to help you, Vanilla-chama.

02:44.760 --> 02:46.890
Wow! She's cute...

02:46.890 --> 02:48.730
A rat for a familiar, eh?

02:49.930 --> 02:51.760
Silence, Chocolat!

02:51.760 --> 02:54.830
I am not a rat, I am a mouse.

02:56.030 --> 03:01.710
Vanilla-chama, now that I'm here,
collecting hearts will be a cinch!

03:01.710 --> 03:05.830
You'll take piles of human hearts,
and become the Queen!

03:06.510 --> 03:07.880
I'll do my best...

03:07.880 --> 03:09.880
Huh? Where's my familiar?

03:10.980 --> 03:13.120
You didn't come out together?

03:13.120 --> 03:14.350
No clue.

03:15.020 --> 03:17.920
No doubt it's as dumb as its master.

03:19.860 --> 03:21.330
Why you little...

03:21.330 --> 03:22.860
I'll whup your butt!

03:22.860 --> 03:24.160
Master-chama!

03:24.160 --> 03:26.050
Chocolat-chan, please stop it!

03:35.070 --> 03:39.110
Vanilla-chama, how many hearts
have you taken so far?

03:40.710 --> 03:42.600
I haven't taken one yet.

03:42.600 --> 03:46.400
But Chocolat-chan took a honey colored heart.

03:46.750 --> 03:48.050
Honey colored?

03:51.720 --> 03:55.030
That's just a heart that comes out
when someone's surprised.

03:55.030 --> 03:56.960
It's the least valuable heart.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.160
Least valuable?

03:58.760 --> 04:01.430
The honey colored "pee"
hearts are worth 5 ecure.

04:01.430 --> 04:03.400
Orange ones are worth 300 ecure.

04:03.400 --> 04:05.400
Pink ones are 1000 ecure.

04:05.400 --> 04:08.070
Purple are 2500 ecure.

04:08.070 --> 04:11.440
And a red heart is 5000 ecure!

04:11.440 --> 04:13.040
I get it!

04:13.040 --> 04:17.420
Alright, I'm gonna try my
best to get a red heart!

04:17.420 --> 04:19.450
That's way out of your league, Chocolat.

04:20.350 --> 04:23.390
Why you... I'm totally gonna whup your butt!

04:23.390 --> 04:26.720
In any case, Vanilla-chama, fight bravely!

04:30.260 --> 04:33.060
If you ever need something,
do not hesitate to call.

04:34.030 --> 04:35.930
Chocolat-chan, are you okay?

04:37.300 --> 04:40.740
I am SO going to whup that rat's butt...

04:48.110 --> 04:50.320
Those are the girls from our class.

04:50.920 --> 04:52.380
What's going on?

04:53.250 --> 04:55.120
Ah, it's HIM.

04:58.920 --> 05:00.990
Hey, who is that guy?

05:00.990 --> 05:02.860
He's Prince Pierre-sama.

05:02.860 --> 05:06.300
He's the president of the middle school's
student council and captain of the fencing club!

05:06.760 --> 05:10.900
By the way, we're in the elementary
school's Pierre-sama fan club...

05:10.900 --> 05:11.800
Good morning.

05:16.980 --> 05:19.210
What the...? Do you guys know each other?

05:19.210 --> 05:21.370
He even said "Good morning" to you...

05:21.680 --> 05:23.380
How do you know each other?

05:24.150 --> 05:25.620
He's one of my followers.

05:25.620 --> 05:28.820
Hey, don't even joke about that...

05:28.820 --> 05:31.190
Just kidding, he's my brother.

05:31.890 --> 05:33.380
Really? Wow...

05:33.380 --> 05:34.890
Gotcha!

05:34.890 --> 05:35.830
Aw man!

05:35.830 --> 05:37.000
I totally fell for it!

05:38.660 --> 05:39.730
Are you Chocolat?

05:41.300 --> 05:46.340
Even though the Prince said "Good morning"
to you, why didn't you greet him in return?

05:47.640 --> 05:49.310
Remember this.

05:49.310 --> 05:54.480
It's unthinkable that a rude girl like
you could get close to the Prince.

05:56.010 --> 05:58.850
Aren't you guys the rude ones?

05:58.850 --> 06:00.420
What's with this "Prince" guy?

06:00.950 --> 06:03.520
I'm ignoring that jerk!

06:04.090 --> 06:05.460
What did you say?

06:05.460 --> 06:06.390
I'm sorry!

06:07.030 --> 06:09.930
Why are YOU apologizing, Vanilla?

06:09.930 --> 06:11.430
But...

06:11.430 --> 06:12.400
Stop this.

06:20.740 --> 06:21.740
Yuriko...

06:22.570 --> 06:24.410
I apologize.

06:24.810 --> 06:30.520
Their words may be harsh, but
they simply value politeness.

06:31.680 --> 06:32.280
But...

06:33.920 --> 06:35.720
Please understand.

06:37.390 --> 06:38.390
Let's go.

06:44.160 --> 06:45.830
Quite an impertinent girl, isn't she?

06:46.730 --> 06:51.800
I will capture that strong-willed
girl, and bend her will to mine.

06:55.770 --> 07:00.010
Girls are at their most beautiful
when they are asleep.

07:02.750 --> 07:05.150
The "Members" have got
their eye on you, it seems.

07:05.850 --> 07:07.190
Members?

07:07.190 --> 07:12.000
Only pretty girls from the middle school
can join. It's Pierre-sama's fan club.

07:12.620 --> 07:14.190
They might be pretty, but...

07:14.190 --> 07:15.690
They look scary...

07:17.030 --> 07:17.900
Matsuda!

07:19.300 --> 07:21.400
You do ballet, right?

07:21.400 --> 07:22.730
But you're such a klutz!

07:23.400 --> 07:24.170
That's so cruel...

07:28.710 --> 07:30.340
Sugar Sugar Rune!

07:30.340 --> 07:31.480
Choco Rune!

07:36.550 --> 07:37.320
Wand!

07:46.590 --> 07:47.310
Alright!

07:49.690 --> 07:50.800
Sugar Sugar Rune!

07:51.080 --> 07:51.930
Choco Rune!

07:55.170 --> 07:56.450
What the...

07:56.450 --> 07:58.000
I can't stop!

08:02.810 --> 08:05.610
Cut it out, and stop making fun of girls.

08:06.280 --> 08:06.940
Got it?

08:06.940 --> 08:07.980
Understand?

08:09.580 --> 08:10.820
Why that damned Kato...

08:11.520 --> 08:13.250
Hey, wait, Kato!

08:14.750 --> 08:15.750
W-What's this?

08:18.420 --> 08:19.360
Strange frog.

08:19.790 --> 08:21.790
Whoa! What's that?

08:21.790 --> 08:23.880
Isn't that an alien life form?!

08:24.500 --> 08:26.260
Not that again...

08:26.260 --> 08:28.000
It's just a frog.

08:29.050 --> 08:29.800
Aha!

08:31.100 --> 08:36.540
Pierre-sama is outstanding in both grades
and athletics; he's great at everything!

08:36.970 --> 08:41.680
Ever since he entered Moegi Academy,
he's been the super-best student!

08:44.520 --> 08:45.920
Ah, it's the bell.

08:46.550 --> 08:48.220
I wonder what class is next?

08:49.120 --> 08:52.020
I stuck that frog in her desk...

08:53.660 --> 08:58.660
You sure love the classic pranks, don't you?

09:04.270 --> 09:05.440
That's perfect!

09:07.670 --> 09:09.440
C-Cute...

09:10.580 --> 09:12.010
A frog is cute?

09:12.010 --> 09:13.010
You've got to be kidding me...

09:13.010 --> 09:14.310
Is she going to eat it?

09:14.310 --> 09:16.150
No, I'm not going to eat it!

09:16.150 --> 09:17.650
You pickin' a fight?!

09:20.150 --> 09:21.750
But it really is...

09:21.750 --> 09:22.920
Cute, don't you think?

09:24.060 --> 09:26.120
Vanilla-chan sure is kind...

09:26.120 --> 09:27.930
She even like frogs...

09:27.930 --> 09:29.330
She's so cute...

09:29.860 --> 09:33.930
Somehow the reaction is different...

09:35.770 --> 09:37.570
Where did you come from?

09:37.570 --> 09:38.540
The forest out back?

09:38.970 --> 09:40.070
Did you get lost?

09:42.970 --> 09:45.780
Can she talk to animals?

09:45.780 --> 09:47.250
I can't believe this...

09:47.250 --> 09:49.680
And besides, she seems
really happy about it.

09:49.680 --> 09:51.680
What's with that woman?

09:51.820 --> 09:54.420
Mimura, she's an alien!

09:54.420 --> 09:56.050
Shut up, you!

09:56.950 --> 09:59.420
Okay, everyone. Take your seats.

10:00.760 --> 10:02.530
Wait until break, okay?

10:10.670 --> 10:11.300
Bye bye.

10:12.670 --> 10:14.290
Don't get caught again.

10:14.570 --> 10:18.080
Eh? Guess she's a good person.

10:20.180 --> 10:24.050
There must be all kinds of mysterious
alien life forms that came from space!

10:24.050 --> 10:25.750
"Just a frog," yeah right.

10:27.520 --> 10:30.090
It's your loss, Jun.

10:30.090 --> 10:31.090
Shut it.

10:33.320 --> 10:34.760
Huh? What is it?

10:35.730 --> 10:36.590
You can go now.

10:40.160 --> 10:41.730
You, over there!

10:41.730 --> 10:42.600
What?

10:43.200 --> 10:46.570
If you've got some beef with me, come
over here and say it to my face!

10:48.110 --> 10:52.580
If you wanna fight, I'll face you any
time! Fair and square, that is!

10:54.480 --> 10:56.210
If you don't listen to us...

10:56.210 --> 10:56.980
We'll whup your butt!

10:57.350 --> 10:58.350
We'll whup your butt!

11:00.180 --> 11:01.150
That's fun!

11:01.850 --> 11:02.350
Brats!

11:02.350 --> 11:04.660
Damn you, what's with that!

11:06.560 --> 11:10.460
Ah, I've gotten myself
even more unpopular now.

11:11.800 --> 11:15.130
At this rate, I'll never
collect any more hearts.

11:15.870 --> 11:18.090
And what can you do when
you're that half-hearted?

11:21.410 --> 11:24.710
Now that I'm here,
you'll definitely get to be Queen!

11:40.890 --> 11:42.530
You can really talk?

11:42.990 --> 11:44.430
That's right.

11:44.430 --> 11:47.230
This frog couldn't be... my familiar?

11:47.230 --> 11:50.530
Not "this frog"... Call me Duke.

11:51.140 --> 11:53.570
Why didn't you come out this morning?!

11:53.570 --> 11:55.270
I was sleepy.

11:55.270 --> 11:56.270
I'll whup your butt!

11:56.870 --> 12:01.250
It's because of that prickly attitude
that you can't collect any hearts.

12:01.950 --> 12:03.680
What did you say?!

12:03.680 --> 12:05.580
Well, you have nothing to worry about.

12:06.520 --> 12:12.420
Since I'll give you advice about guys, you'll
be collecting plenty of hearts from now on!

12:12.920 --> 12:14.290
No way, really?

12:17.830 --> 12:20.030
Speaking of which...

12:20.030 --> 12:24.370
Walking with a frog riding
on your head ain't normal.

12:24.370 --> 12:25.470
Chocolat-chan!

12:26.940 --> 12:27.540
Vanilla.

12:28.170 --> 12:29.910
Well, you didn't come back, so...

12:30.570 --> 12:33.180
Ah, it's Mr. Frog from before.

12:33.180 --> 12:34.380
I'm Duke!

12:35.050 --> 12:37.620
So he's your familiar!

12:37.620 --> 12:38.680
Pleased to meet you.

12:39.320 --> 12:40.250
Pleased to meet you.

12:41.020 --> 12:43.920
Chocolat, look at the way she smiles.

12:45.260 --> 12:52.700
To challenge a man's heart, a girl must have
a bashful smile like a spring breeze!

12:54.870 --> 12:55.970
Like this?

12:55.970 --> 12:58.470
Ah, enough! That's totally wrong!

12:59.800 --> 13:00.830
I got it...

13:00.830 --> 13:01.470
Like this!

13:01.470 --> 13:03.610
You're getting colder and colder.

13:06.140 --> 13:08.780
How about this one then?!

13:09.210 --> 13:11.570
It'd be better the way it was before!

13:14.520 --> 13:17.690
Seems the Queen selection
battle is already decided.

13:18.090 --> 13:19.360
Blanca...

13:19.990 --> 13:21.130
Vanilla-chama.

13:22.930 --> 13:24.820
Even though she's a candidate to become Queen,

13:24.820 --> 13:27.530
she sure made a crude familiar, don't you think?

13:27.530 --> 13:29.270
Shut up with the "chu chu"!

13:29.270 --> 13:31.270
You're the one that's crudely drawn!

13:31.270 --> 13:32.440
What did you say?

13:33.170 --> 13:34.940
Second-rate, second-rate!

13:35.670 --> 13:36.640
Let's do this!

13:42.350 --> 13:46.320
Being insulted by some dumb
frog is hardly humiliating.

13:46.780 --> 13:51.660
But in any case, Vanilla-chama will
be the one to get the most hearts!

13:52.390 --> 13:58.100
Naive, aren't you? Now that I'm with her,
even Chocolat can take bunches of hearts.

13:58.100 --> 14:00.630
Hey! What'd you mean by "even Chocolat?"

14:00.630 --> 14:01.830
"Even?!"

14:01.830 --> 14:04.140
It's impossible for your master!

14:03.130 --> 14:06.100
Chocolat-chan, gym class is starting.

14:04.140 --> 14:07.270
Yeah, right! Vanilla hasn't even taken one yet!

14:06.770 --> 14:07.970
Hurry or you'll be late.

14:07.270 --> 14:08.440
Impossible.

14:08.440 --> 14:09.110
No, it's not!

14:08.440 --> 14:10.960
Ah, you're right. Let's go.

14:09.110 --> 14:10.270
Impossible, impossible, impossible!

14:10.270 --> 14:10.960
No, it's not!

14:11.680 --> 14:14.400
So, today we'll be using the vaulting box.

14:14.810 --> 14:17.150
Pay careful attention to
the timing of your jump.

14:17.650 --> 14:18.780
Okay!

14:18.780 --> 14:23.620
First, we'll have a match during this class
to see who can take the most hearts!

14:23.620 --> 14:25.120
Sure thing!

14:26.190 --> 14:27.020
Chocolat...

14:27.390 --> 14:30.130
I'll show you how to time your take-off.

14:30.560 --> 14:34.330
I see! Since you're a frog, jumping
should be your specialty.

14:34.330 --> 14:35.420
Heh, heh.

14:37.570 --> 14:39.870
Chocolat Kato, here I go!

14:43.310 --> 14:44.010
Now!

14:44.680 --> 14:45.510
Alright!

14:49.180 --> 14:49.980
I did it!

14:51.080 --> 14:52.020
Now let's see...

14:53.920 --> 14:54.690
Where are the hearts?

14:54.690 --> 14:55.720
Whoa...

14:55.720 --> 14:57.520
As I figured...

14:57.520 --> 14:58.490
Just like a monkey...

14:58.490 --> 15:00.020
That didn't work AT ALL!

15:00.360 --> 15:02.010
That's strange...

15:03.760 --> 15:04.860
Naive.

15:05.360 --> 15:07.630
You can't take hearts like that.

15:08.270 --> 15:09.900
Vanilla-chama, listen up...

15:11.340 --> 15:14.170
Next, Ice-san!

15:14.650 --> 15:15.170
Yes!

15:17.840 --> 15:20.310
Vanilla Ice... here I go...

15:23.010 --> 15:23.870
Now!

15:30.350 --> 15:32.360
Owwy!

15:32.360 --> 15:36.630
I didn't want to trip... but I suddenly fell.

15:40.060 --> 15:40.720
Whoa.

15:41.030 --> 15:43.500
Now, your spell, Vanilla-chan.

15:43.500 --> 15:45.070
But now...

15:50.940 --> 15:55.010
Vanilla-chama, I'm not worthy...

15:58.820 --> 16:01.490
What's with the band aid? Look's stupid.

16:03.050 --> 16:05.560
She got hurt, so she can't
do anything about it.

16:05.560 --> 16:07.760
Ah, it's embarrasing.

16:10.290 --> 16:11.920
This is... could it be...

16:12.160 --> 16:14.230
Yeah! Hearts have appeared!

16:16.970 --> 16:18.300
Sugar Sugar Rune!

16:19.100 --> 16:20.040
Vani Rune!

16:22.540 --> 16:23.070
Wand!

16:24.580 --> 16:26.680
Heart, Heart, please come to me!

16:37.090 --> 16:39.120
I... I took them!

16:39.660 --> 16:42.880
Chocolat-chan, look! I took so many.

16:42.880 --> 16:44.700
W-Wow.

16:47.130 --> 16:49.170
Rat, be very afraid.

16:50.030 --> 16:54.170
Ah, somehow I've lost my self confidence.

16:54.810 --> 17:00.740
If I can take this many hearts, I'm sure
you can take a lot too, Chocolat-chan.

17:00.740 --> 17:02.410
You think?

17:02.410 --> 17:08.250
Sure. I'm sure you'll take more than
that one honey-colored heart.

17:08.250 --> 17:10.190
Aha... I see.

17:10.850 --> 17:14.430
Argh, compared to the rat
you're no help at ALL.

17:14.430 --> 17:15.660
Ow, ow, ow.

17:16.090 --> 17:18.760
Can't you think of ONE good idea?

17:19.660 --> 17:24.670
Man, it would have been better if I had
been surprised when we first met.

17:26.940 --> 17:29.370
I just had a good idea!

17:29.370 --> 17:30.370
Oh, what?

17:30.870 --> 17:34.410
What about if you act cute and
surprised at something?

17:35.050 --> 17:36.450
At what?

17:36.450 --> 17:39.120
Well, I'll just go and search for something.

17:44.220 --> 17:49.090
Oh? Then your mom is going to New York?

17:49.090 --> 17:50.960
Yeah, for research.

17:50.960 --> 17:53.030
That's so cool!

17:53.820 --> 17:56.130
Are you going with her?

17:58.070 --> 17:59.000
You don't want to go?

17:59.840 --> 18:02.740
I'm not good with planes.

18:03.440 --> 18:05.310
Isn't flying in the sky scary?

18:06.140 --> 18:09.210
Yeah, it is kinda scary.

18:09.910 --> 18:10.980
...kinda scary.

18:11.620 --> 18:12.580
That's it!

18:16.650 --> 18:18.060
Just leave it to me.

18:18.060 --> 18:21.860
I know what human girls are scared of.

18:21.860 --> 18:22.690
Really?

18:23.130 --> 18:26.000
That is the result of my investigation.

18:26.430 --> 18:32.840
But this time, we'll have to use some
decent magic, so I'll help out.

18:32.840 --> 18:35.870
Before that, we should practice
acting scared for a bit.

18:36.270 --> 18:37.540
Scary!

18:37.540 --> 18:39.310
Ah, that's no good at all!

18:39.740 --> 18:41.610
Scaaary!

18:41.610 --> 18:42.780
One more time!

18:42.780 --> 18:45.220
Scaaarrry!

18:45.220 --> 18:46.850
Alright, let's do it!

18:46.850 --> 18:47.750
I'll do it!

18:47.750 --> 18:51.220
I'll show you I can take all orange
hearts, just like Vanilla!

18:52.660 --> 18:54.860
So that I can become the Queen
of the Magical World!

18:56.530 --> 18:57.860
Sugar Sugar Rune!

18:57.860 --> 18:58.900
Choco Rune!

19:03.430 --> 19:04.800
Sugar Sugar Rune!

19:04.800 --> 19:05.860
Choco Rune!

19:06.040 --> 19:07.600
Fly in the sky!

19:14.310 --> 19:15.010
What the...?

19:17.110 --> 19:20.050
Duke, what kind of magic is this?

19:24.890 --> 19:26.620
Ah, we're flying!

19:26.620 --> 19:27.850
What's going on?

19:28.130 --> 19:30.960
Aliens are full of
mysteries, don't you think?

19:31.500 --> 19:35.170
Chocolat-chan, why did you
do this kind of magic?

19:35.170 --> 19:36.430
Because she's an idiot.

19:37.230 --> 19:38.700
Somehow or another...

19:39.200 --> 19:43.170
Now, just like we practiced it, act scared!

19:43.170 --> 19:46.940
It's not the time for that! Everyone
else is even MORE scared!

19:48.650 --> 19:50.480
Maybe I overdid it a bit.

19:50.980 --> 19:53.440
Hurry and change things back!

19:53.750 --> 19:54.950
Fine.

19:55.450 --> 19:56.950
Sugar Sugar Rune!

19:56.950 --> 19:58.320
Change Back Rune!

20:01.230 --> 20:03.960
Hey, didn't something roll?

20:03.960 --> 20:05.200
Was it my imagination?

20:05.200 --> 20:06.560
P...Phew.

20:07.900 --> 20:09.450
Kya! Chocolat-chan!

20:11.400 --> 20:12.670
What the heck?

20:12.670 --> 20:14.510
We're upside down!

20:14.510 --> 20:16.540
Oh? Did I make a mistake?

20:16.540 --> 20:19.840
Wah! Hurry, hurry! Change it back!

20:19.840 --> 20:21.010
Okay!

20:21.010 --> 20:22.110
Sugar Sugar Rune!

20:22.110 --> 20:23.480
Spin Rune!

20:25.980 --> 20:28.120
What was it now?

20:28.590 --> 20:31.860
Dunno, but... I'm dizzy, and queasy...

20:32.220 --> 20:33.990
There we go, perfect!

20:33.990 --> 20:36.630
I also cast an amnesia spell.

20:36.630 --> 20:38.860
Since no one will remember
it, everything'll be okay.

20:39.360 --> 20:40.900
That's NOT the problem.

20:42.300 --> 20:45.840
Chocolat-chan, you sure have
a troublesome familiar.

20:48.170 --> 20:50.820
I wonder if I can take a heart?

20:50.820 --> 20:53.180
We can do it together, Chocolat!

20:54.910 --> 20:55.850
I'm worried...

20:59.780 --> 21:01.550
And now the reessults!

21:04.960 --> 21:08.820
5 orange colored hearts are worth 1500 ecure.

21:09.990 --> 21:13.030
Vanilla-chama, let's keep it going like this.

21:13.560 --> 21:13.930
Sure.

21:15.070 --> 21:16.100
And Chocolat?

21:18.140 --> 21:21.470
What? You didn't even take one?

21:22.070 --> 21:25.610
Well, that's about what I expected.

21:27.240 --> 21:29.110
It's not over yet, Chocolat.

21:29.950 --> 21:31.250
Like you should talk.

21:34.720 --> 21:37.580
The battle for love, is steep and fierce.

21:38.560 --> 21:42.560
However, there is nothing more
beautiful than "love."

21:44.390 --> 21:46.600
Ah, man.

21:47.360 --> 21:49.600
Vanilla's taken the lead.

21:50.670 --> 21:51.800
Don't worry about it.

21:51.800 --> 21:53.340
We'll do our best tomorrow.

21:54.170 --> 21:56.670
Your best isn't going to help any.

21:58.780 --> 22:01.410
And why the heck are you in here with me?!

22:01.950 --> 22:04.210
Just a little... girl talk.

22:04.800 --> 22:06.080
Butt whuppin' time!

22:08.890 --> 22:12.720
Pray for me too, Mama. That
I'll take a heart tomorrow!

22:23.160 --> 22:29.470
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.600 --> 22:30.970
"Love"

22:31.910 --> 22:35.410
A magic spell.

22:37.580 --> 22:44.850
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.280 --> 22:54.360
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.030 --> 23:00.300
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.900 --> 23:03.970
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.270 --> 23:11.340
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.710 --> 23:16.150
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.150 --> 23:26.260
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.320 --> 23:35.170
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.210 --> 23:49.000
The newspaper club took my picture.

23:49.000 --> 23:50.190
Interview me?

23:50.670 --> 23:54.200
Ah, that boy's heart is shining orange!

23:54.200 --> 23:55.090
This's my chance!

23:55.090 --> 23:56.160
I'll take it right away!

23:56.990 --> 23:59.290
But something's strange.

23:59.290 --> 24:01.290
He's fighting with his friends.

24:01.290 --> 24:02.810
I wonder why?

24:02.810 --> 24:05.410
Ah, I missed my chance!

24:06.410 --> 24:08.210
Next time on: Sugar Sugar Rune.

24:08.760 --> 24:10.810
Unscheduled Newspaper Club Interview.

24:10.810 --> 24:12.470
If you don't watch, I'll whup your butt!

24:12.470 --> 24:13.410
Thanks!
